          #CohomologicalSpectralSequenceOfAnExactCouple.num_prop
            %h6#proposition Proposition
            %p
              %strong (cohomological spectral sequence of an exact couple)
            %p
              Given an exact couple, def.
              = succeed "," do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ExactCoupleAndDerivedExactCouple"}
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mrow
                      %mtable
                        %mtr
                          %mtd
                            %msub
                              %mi D
                              %mn 1
                          %mtd
                          %mtd
                            %mover
                              %mo ⟶
                              %mrow
                                %msub
                                  %mi g
                                  %mn 1
                          %mtd
                          %mtd
                            %msub
                              %mi D
                              %mn 1
                        %mtr
                          %mtd
                          %mtd
                            %msub
