            %p where in last two steps we used once more the exactness of the exact couple.
            %p#InfinityPageIsSubgroupOfImageOfFirstPageUnderf
              (Notice that the above equation means in particular that the
              = succeed "-page" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
